      "writtenOn": "2017-12-29T19:24:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Variant has a specific meaning in soong, it is a specific variant of a module that is built multiple ways.  Arch is one of the variations of a module, others include host vs. host_cross (windows) vs. device, or static vs. shared for a cc_library, or vendor vs. core.\n\nI\u0027d just call this Arch.",
