      "writtenOn": "2018-01-03T04:45:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Arch is already reserved for arch variant in soong.\nHow about Target_arch? This is the arch variant that the module is targeting to build.\nSo the Android.bp will look like:\n\nvndk_prebuilt_shared {\n    name: \"libutils\",\n    version: \"27\",\n    target_arch: \"arm64\",\n    vendor_available: true,\n    vndk: {\n        enabled: true,\n        support_system_process: true,\n    },\n    notice: \"NOTICE_FILES/libutils.so.txt\",\n    arch: {\n        arm: {\n            srcs: [\"arch-arm-armv7-a-neon/shared/vndk-sp/libutils.so\"],\n        },\n        arm64: {\n            srcs: [\"arch-arm64-armv8-a/shared/vndk-sp/libutils.so\"],\n        },\n    },\n}",
